                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got this as a gift a long time ago, and have enjoyed playing a run here and there over the years. I actually find this one easier to play on mute so I can focus on the shapes, though I know that's not the norm for rhythm games LOL even though I'm not the target audience for something like this I think there's a lot of fun to be had with it, and I'd recommend it for people with more rhythm than I have!",
